(text
"20-way keyed straight-through cable, maximum 50mm. NOT ARM JTAG.\nPanel VBAT is 3.3V, NEVER the 2S battery. IOVCC is 1.8V per panel datasheet.\nTouch is held in reset; ordinary mainboard buttons remain the user controls.\nIM0 / IM1 and TE are NC. VCI_EN follows 1.8V via 0R with 100k pull-down.\nRetain primary/secondary isolation on mainboard; display is entirely in battery domain."
(at
20.32
213.36
0)
