(size
1.5
1.5))
(justify
left
top))
(uuid
"b45747c6-70d6-49a2-aa9d-fadac2bf5b38"))
(text
"Assembly: screen glass/FPC are mechanically supported above this carrier, not by the BTB connector.\nOCN female footprint uses Rev B SOCKET drawing (page 3), NOT page 1 HEADER lands.\nVerify mating pin1 against screen FPC before first power-on. No alternative connector assumed compatible.\nEngineering prototype: check rails, inrush, screen init and EEG noise with display enabled/disabled."
